      "srv_descriptions": {
        "none": [
          "Freeling IT is a web service that performs sentence splitting, tokenization, part-of-speech tagging, morphological analysis and lemmatization on Italian texts only. It was originally deployed within the EU-FP7-STREP PANACEA project (www.panacea-lr.eu) and implements the Freeling 2.1 libraries with no modification of the original code (which is available at http://devel.cpl.upc.edu/freeling/downloads?order=time&desc=1).\r\nFor a description of the Freeling tool see Lluís Padró and Miquel Collado and Samuel Reese and Marina Lloberes and Irene Castellón. FreeLing 2.1: Five Years of Open-Source Language Processing Tools Proceedings of 7th Language Resources and Evaluation Conference (LREC 2010), ELRA La Valletta, Malta. May, 2010."
        ]
      },
